  <section id="technical-profile" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">
          The tools and experience behind my work
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Technical Profile</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Technologies I have used across more than a decade and 80+ projects. This experience
          helps me design systems, give agents the right work, build reliable feedback loops, find
          problems, and prove the result works. TypeScript and PHP are where I have the longest history.
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-7 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Programming</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            TypeScript, JavaScript, PHP, Ruby, Python, Kotlin, Go, C#, Elixir, Delphi
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Frameworks</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            React/Next.js, Vue/Nuxt, Svelte, Electron, Flutter, Tailwind, Node.js/NestJS/Bun/Deno, Laravel/Symfony/Phalcon, Rails, Django/Flask, Express/AdonisJS, Phoenix
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Data & interfaces</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite, MongoDB, DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, Redis, REST, GraphQL, tRPC, OpenAPI
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Infrastructure</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            AWS, GCP, Azure, Docker, Fly.io, Vercel, CI/CD, Linux, Terraform, CDK, OpenTofu, Ansible, Chef
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Testing</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            State-machine, unit, integration, acceptance, smoke, BDD, and end-to-end testing with Gherkin, Jest, Cypress, Playwright, RSpec, Pest, and Cucumber
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3 sm:col-span-2">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Practices</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            Microservices, monoliths, DDD, clear issues and plans, acceptance criteria, definition of done, coding agents, deterministic feedback loops, automated and manual QA
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-i-work" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">Building software with coding agents</p>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">How I work</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#4f4034]">
        Coding agents produce the implementation. I make sure the issue and plan are correct, set
        clear acceptance criteria and a definition of done, and give the agent deterministic ways
        to follow the rules and prove the result works.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-9 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">1.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Define the issue</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I turn the goal into a clear issue with expected behavior, limits, acceptance criteria, and a definition of done.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">2.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Check the plan</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I make sure the plan fits the system, including its data, APIs, operations, risks, and existing behavior.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">3.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">
            Set the feedback loops
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            Deterministic rules, state machines, and feedback loops keep the agent on course and make failures clear enough to fix.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">4.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Prove it works</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            Testing runs at several levels and layers. Automated checks and QA run first, then I manually test the result before deciding it is done.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4 md:col-span-2 md:max-w-[calc(50%-1.5rem)]">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">5.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Get up to speed</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            Work across more than 80 projects has taught me how to understand unfamiliar systems,
            find the important parts, and contribute without needing one familiar stack or domain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="testimonial" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <figure class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl border border-[#9b7659] px-6 py-12 sm:px-14 sm:py-14">
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -left-1.5 -top-1.5 size-3 rotate-45 border border-[#8d6b50] bg-[#f3ebdc]"
