      </span>
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -right-1.5 -top-1.5 size-3 rotate-45 border border-[#8d6b50] bg-[#f3ebdc]"
      >
      </span>
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -bottom-1.5 -left-1.5 size-3 rotate-45 border border-[#8d6b50] bg-[#f3ebdc]"
      >
      </span>
      <span
