        class="absolute -bottom-1.5 -right-1.5 size-3 rotate-45 border border-[#8d6b50] bg-[#f3ebdc]"
      >
      </span>

      <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-4 mx-auto w-fit bg-[#f3ebdc] px-5 text-center font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">
        A word from a client
      </figcaption>
      <blockquote>
        <p class="text-center font-serif text-2xl leading-10 text-[#30231a] sm:text-3xl sm:leading-[1.45]">
          Andrei is a one of a kind senior AI-powered developer that would be an immense added
          value on any team. Not only is he a master of the latest Agentic-AI workflows, but he
          ensures the quality of work that comes out is impeccable. He uses very sophisticated AI
          workflows for producing any full-stack feature in very fast speed with top-notch quality.
          For anyone looking to hire Andrei on any project, you cannot go wrong, hire immediately;
          he will make your project much better, and very fast. The best developer I've come across
          in the past 20 years or so. This is what a top-notch developer should look like in 2026.
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-center text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-[#b9a58e]"></span>
          <span>
            <strong class="font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Frederic Haddad</strong>
            <br /> Head of Business Development · FinancialDocs
          </span>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-[#b9a58e]"></span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section id="ask-me-about" class="py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">Good conversation starters</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Ask me about</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          The experience behind the résumé and how I build software today.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t-2 border-[#8d6b50]">
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Working across many stacks
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            TypeScript and PHP are where I have the deepest history. I have also worked with JavaScript, Ruby, Python, Kotlin, Go, C#, Elixir, and Delphi. This helps me define the right work, build useful tests, and understand where problems come from.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            80+ projects as a freelancer
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            From 2011 to 2019, I delivered 80+ projects across CRM, SaaS, and e-commerce, handling client requirements, architecture, implementation, and ongoing maintenance across web, desktop, and mobile stacks.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
